														<r3d:remarks>BRICS - Biomedical Research Informatics Computing System is a dynamic, expanding, and easily reproducible informatics ecosystem developed to create secure, centralized biomedical databases to support research efforts to accelerate scientific discovery, by aggregating and sharing data using Web-based clinical report form generators and a data dictionary of Clinical Data Elements. BRICS has been used so far to support multiple neurobiological studies, including  the National Ophthalmic Disease Genotyping and Phenotyping Network (eyeGENE).
EyeGENE is part of National Eye Institute Data Commons https://www.re3data.org/repository/r3d100014148</r3d:remarks>
